00:09:32.972 --> 00:09:35.408
there could be some sort of third party

00:09:35.408 --> 00:09:37.710
run that might involve Senator Manchin.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.945
What is your sense of all that?

00:09:38.945 --> 00:09:39.845
Would that be healthy

00:09:39.845 --> 00:09:41.447
for the Democratic Party

00:09:41.447 --> 00:09:43.149
if Joe Manchin were to jump into this

00:09:46.352 --> 00:09:46.986
candidate?

00:09:46.986 --> 00:09:47.620
At the end of the

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:51.023
day, we all have an opportunity

00:09:51.424 --> 00:09:52.925
in this democratic process

00:09:52.925 --> 00:09:54.193
to come forward.

00:09:54.193 --> 00:09:56.562
But again, I went back towards

00:09:57.196 --> 00:09:58.698
one of those deliverables,

00:09:58.698 --> 00:09:59.699
those things

00:09:59.699 --> 00:10:01.033
that people are concerned

00:10:01.033 --> 00:10:02.702
about, Eastern North Carolinians,

00:10:02.702 --> 00:10:03.736
what they talked about

00:10:03.736 --> 00:10:04.870
at the dinner table.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:07.873
And I do believe that President Biden,

00:10:07.873 --> 00:10:08.874
even though, again,

00:10:08.874 --> 00:10:11.377
we haven't always agreed,

00:10:11.377 --> 00:10:12.678
he has delivered.

00:10:12.678 --> 00:10:13.279
Matter of fact,

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:14.013
we always hear

00:10:14.013 --> 00:10:14.981
do you think President Biden

00:10:14.981 --> 00:10:16.549
should have any chance?

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:17.984
Do you mind if I just jump?

00:10:17.984 --> 00:10:18.784
Do you think President Biden

00:10:18.784 --> 00:10:20.186
should have any challengers

00:10:20.186 --> 00:10:21.487
or do you think he should run unopposed

00:10:21.487 --> 00:10:22.021
on the Democrats?

00:10:22.021 --> 00:10:23.155
I believe in a Democrat.

00:10:23.155 --> 00:10:25.091
I believe in the Democratic process.

00:10:25.091 --> 00:10:25.891
And I believe

00:10:25.891 --> 00:10:28.361
the American people in the end

00:10:28.361 --> 00:10:31.063
will deliver for those who deliver

00:10:31.063 --> 00:10:31.430
for them.

00:10:33.032 --> 00:10:33.532
All right.

00:10:33.532 --> 00:10:34.734
Congressman Don Davis,

00:10:34.734 --> 00:10:35.701
thanks very much for your time.

00:10:35.701 --> 00:10:36.802
We appreciate it.

00:10:38.337 --> 00:10:38.838
Thanks, Joe.

